# /brag video output — build artefacts, regenerate with the plan + composition.
# The whole directory, not just the renders: the frame dumps and stills beside
# them run to tens of megabytes, they slow every eslint run to a crawl because
# the linter still walks them, and one absent-minded `git add -A` would put a
# video repository into a source one.
brag-output/
brag-output-*/
my-video/
